 fast is not recommended for anyone with high risk. Adequate hydration is important even during the period of fasting.", "runs": [{"text": "A total fast is not recommended for anyone with high risk."}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Adequate hydration is important even during the period of "}, {"text": "fasting."}], "list": {"level": 3, "numberingId": "924"}}, {"id": "body-20233", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "For those on insulin, a partial fast is preferred to total or normal forms of fasting.", "runs": [{"text": "For"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "those"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "on"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "insulin,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "a"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "partial"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "fast"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "is"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "preferred"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "to"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "total"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "or"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "normal"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "forms"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "of"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "fasting."}], "list": {"level": 3, "numberingId": "924"}}, {"id": "body-20234", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Self-blood glucose monitoring is mandatory for people with diabetes who elect to fast.", "runs": [{"text": "Self-blood"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "glucose"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "monitoring"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "is"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "mandatory"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "for"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "people"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "with"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "diabetes"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "who"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "elect"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "to"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "fast."}], "list": {"level": 3, "numberingId": "924"}}, {"id": "body-20235", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Once-a-day is adequate for patients on diet only or diet with metformin.", "runs": [{"text": "Once-a-day"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "is"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "adeq